## JavaScript

Tổng hợp danh sách eBooks về ngôn ngữ lập trình JavaScript.

### Sách JavaScript tổng hợp

- [Eloquent JavaScript](https://eloquentjavascript.net/Eloquent_JavaScript.pdf)
- [Learning JavaScript (RIP Tutorial)](https://riptutorial.com/Download/javascript.pdf)
- [JavaScript Notes for Professionals](https://goalkicker.com/JavaScriptBook/JavaScriptNotesForProfessionals.pdf)
- [A Smarter Way to Learn JavaScript](https://cdn.wccftech.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/JavaScript.pdf)
- [JavaScript: The Good Parts](https://cdn.tc-library.org/Rhizr/Files/daaz74mzphKfnHsen/files/JavaScript-%20The%20Good%20Parts.pdf)
- [JavaScript from ES5 to ESNext](https://flaviocopes.com/books/es5-to-next.pdf)
- [The JavaScript Beginner's Handbook](https://flaviocopes.com/books/javascript-beginner-handbook.pdf)

### You Don't Know JS - First Edition Series

- [You Don't Know JS: Up & Going](https://xiaoguo.net/~books/Program/You_Dont_Know_JS_Up_and_Going.pdf)
- [You Don't Know JS: Scope & Closures](https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_u1rzdqYCnzcWFLNXd5WHVSUkU/view?resourcekey=0-i0e7RqJVdSjkoZWRLiAgDA)
- [You Don't Know JS: this, Object & Prototypes](https://pepa.holla.cz/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/You-Don-t-Know-JS-this-Object-Prototypes.pdf)
- [You Don't Know JS: Types & Grammar](https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_u1rzdqYCnzWVpkWmI5Y0cxMDg/view?resourcekey=0-ZdH4P0oRSIOuYevPdE2zBw)
- [You Don't Know JS: Async & Performance](https://prima-carta.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/You-Dont-Know-JS_-Async-Performance-PDFDrive-.pdf)
- [You Don't Know JS: ES6 & Beyond](https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_u1rzdqYCnzRUlHcV9sQVpTMFE/view?resourcekey=0-ddQaxhl0oWpCRsiAUfAomQ)

### You Don't Know JS Yet - Second Edition Series

